            <tr><td data-label="Skill">Communication</td><td data-label="Why it matters now">Turns skill into opportunity</td><td data-label="One useful action this week">Practice one 60-second pitch</td></tr>
            <tr><td data-label="Skill">Personal branding</td><td data-label="Why it matters now">Creates inbound attention</td><td data-label="One useful action this week">Share one proof post publicly</td></tr>
            <tr><td data-label="Skill">Storytelling</td><td data-label="Why it matters now">Makes your work memorable</td><td data-label="One useful action this week">Write one before-after-impact case story</td></tr>
