        <div class="card review-card">
          <h3>Review: one-session-only career counselling</h3>
          <p class="line">It can help with first clarity.</p>
          <p class="line">It is usually weak for long-term execution.</p>
          <p class="line">Continuous guidance is more useful when the goal is real skill growth and early financial independence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

